WEBVTT

00:00:02.047 --> 00:00:05.847
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.318 --> 00:00:10.118
Delivers this message

00:00:10.555 --> 00:00:19.122
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.265 --> 00:00:20.732
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:28.840
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:29.135
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:36.644
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.882 --> 00:00:41.012
But please don't look back

00:00:41.153 --> 00:00:45.180
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:49.486
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.761 --> 00:00:53.197
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.465 --> 00:00:57.367
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.769 --> 00:01:01.432
Delivers this message

00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:10.110
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.482 --> 00:01:18.685
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.124 --> 00:01:28.795
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:32.737 --> 00:01:34.898
Before really understanding
what was happening...

00:01:34.973 --> 00:01:37.032
...Shurei and Eigetsu found
themselves being chased...

00:01:37.108 --> 00:01:38.837
...by gangsters from
the Seikin Gang.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:42.277
They escaped into Kogaro, the red-light
district's number one whorehouse.

00:01:43.181 --> 00:01:45.581
There, Ryuki Shi,
the King of Saiunkoku...

00:01:45.650 --> 00:01:47.914
...was reunited
with his beloved Shurei.

00:01:47.986 --> 00:01:50.614
It was quite a heartwarming scene.

00:01:51.523 --> 00:01:56.483
An Unexpected Surprise

00:01:58.530 --> 00:01:59.462
Well?

00:01:59.531 --> 00:02:01.465
What exactly are you doing here?

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.897
I came to see him.

00:02:04.336 --> 00:02:05.963
To see Eigetsu?

00:02:06.571 --> 00:02:09.165
I heard that Shuei took him
under his protection yesterday...

00:02:09.241 --> 00:02:11.175
...and brought him here.

00:02:11.243 --> 00:02:14.542
Lord Ran was in my room,
but he was called out...

00:02:15.080 --> 00:02:18.243
...because the boy was being
harassed by gangsters.

00:02:18.483 --> 00:02:22.920
Then, Miss Kocho, the customer who
left you was General Ran?!

00:02:25.557 --> 00:02:29.186
He's got quite the nerve treating me,
of all people, that way, don't you think?

00:02:31.563 --> 00:02:35.055
Um... Did I have anything
taken from me?

00:02:36.201 --> 00:02:39.693
You know, you're like a totally different
person from the boy I saw yesterday.

00:02:40.405 --> 00:02:42.134
Well, yesterday...!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:46.003
- It's that Seikin Gang again.
- That kid is in serious trouble.

00:02:46.444 --> 00:02:47.911
What's wrong?

00:02:47.979 --> 00:02:51.073
The one who loses in the
drinking match pays for all the drinks.

00:02:51.716 --> 00:02:53.980
Plus an additional
ten gold coins, right?

00:02:54.185 --> 00:02:55.209
You're outta your mind!

00:02:55.287 --> 00:02:57.949
There's no way a little brat
like you could drink so much!

00:02:58.023 --> 00:02:59.615
You used some sort of trick,
didn't you?

00:02:59.691 --> 00:03:02.353
You were the ones who insisted on
the drinking match.

00:03:02.594 --> 00:03:04.255
How could I possibly pull off
some trick?

00:03:04.796 --> 00:03:07.321
Being treated to free drinks was fine...

00:03:08.033 --> 00:03:11.025
...but you could have at least
picked a better quality wine.

00:03:11.937 --> 00:03:13.564
Y-You little bastard!

00:03:13.638 --> 00:03:15.936
I'm gonna strip you
and sell you off!

00:03:20.512 --> 00:03:22.377
One, two, three...!

00:03:22.447 --> 00:03:24.005
Not bad.

00:03:24.082 --> 00:03:26.710
He barely had
ten gold coins on him.

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.157
Why, that's...!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:39.429
And when I found you later,
you were half asleep.

00:03:39.898 --> 00:03:42.526
You insisted on going to
the number one whorehouse in Kiyo...

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:43.965
...so I brought you here.

00:03:44.035 --> 00:03:46.367
You didn't appear to have had
anything taken from you, though.

00:03:46.805 --> 00:03:48.272
But...!

00:03:48.406 --> 00:03:50.374
What was it that you lost?

00:03:50.608 --> 00:03:52.872
W-Well... um...!

00:03:53.345 --> 00:03:54.903
My wooden admittance token!

00:03:57.382 --> 00:03:59.680
It seems they targeted me
because they were after it.

00:04:00.452 --> 00:04:02.647
They said they'd already
collected a lot...

00:04:02.721 --> 00:04:04.348
...so it's possible
other people have also...!

00:04:04.422 --> 00:04:06.390
- They're collecting them?!
- Is this true?!

00:04:06.458 --> 00:04:07.652
Yes.

00:04:08.126 --> 00:04:09.991
Those guys we just
encountered said so.

00:04:12.197 --> 00:04:13.494
Madam Kocho.

00:04:14.065 --> 00:04:15.123
What is it?

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.294
A member of the Seikin Gang
just walked in.

00:04:18.370 --> 00:04:19.359
What?!

00:04:19.437 --> 00:04:23.305
In fact, it's that kid who always
comes here to see Miss Shurei.

00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:25.005
Santa?!

00:04:25.777 --> 00:04:27.540
You idiot, Santa!

00:04:27.612 --> 00:04:30.206
- What relationship do those two have?
- What were you thinking, joining them?

00:04:30.281 --> 00:04:32.511
- They've been friends since childhood.
- Shut up!

00:04:32.584 --> 00:04:35.747
- He's been hitting on her for years.
- Why should I?! You dimwitted airhead!

00:04:35.820 --> 00:04:38.345
- It's been hard to keep him
away from her.
- You don't have to be so hard on me.

00:04:38.423 --> 00:04:40.948
I even threw him in the river
in the winter once.

00:04:41.426 --> 00:04:43.860
I'm surprised that he's still
hanging around her.

00:04:45.530 --> 00:04:47.327
I thought it would be cool.

00:04:47.399 --> 00:04:49.026
I wanted to do something...

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.568
...that would impress the girl I like
and earn her respect.

00:04:52.303 --> 00:04:55.602
And at the same time prove to my
love rival that I could do just as well.

00:04:56.408 --> 00:04:58.035
What does he mean by that?

00:04:58.109 --> 00:04:59.872
What are you
going on about, Santa?

00:04:59.944 --> 00:05:01.377
At any rate...

00:05:01.479 --> 00:05:05.882
...I don't know who this girl you like is,
but that logic of yours is way off.

00:05:06.317 --> 00:05:08.444
At least, if someone tried
to impress me with...

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:13.583
"I've become head of a pack of thugs!
Awesome, aren't I!"

00:05:14.059 --> 00:05:17.392
The moment I heard that,
I'd cut all ties with him right away!

00:05:18.029 --> 00:05:22.523
So, by joining that gang, do you think
you've outdone that love rival of yours?

00:05:24.469 --> 00:05:25.902
I didn't think so.

00:05:26.771 --> 00:05:27.999
I'm really sorry.

00:05:28.073 --> 00:05:31.406
So, is my token at the
Seikin Gang's stronghold?

00:05:32.043 --> 00:05:33.977
Yes. But actually
they're planning to come...

00:05:34.045 --> 00:05:36.377
...and make this place
their new stronghold.

00:05:36.448 --> 00:05:37.881
When?

00:05:37.949 --> 00:05:38.916
Tonight.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.178
So they'll be coming here, bringing
all of those tokens with them, huh?

00:05:42.587 --> 00:05:44.020
How convenient.

00:05:44.089 --> 00:05:45.556
Just a minute, Ran.

00:05:46.024 --> 00:05:48.322
The Seikin Gang is our quarry.

00:05:49.127 --> 00:05:51.027
Circumstances have changed.

00:05:51.096 --> 00:05:53.121
If possible,
I'd like for us to handle this issue.

00:05:53.198 --> 00:05:54.199
Impossible.

00:05:54.199 --> 00:05:57.828
If we don't deal with them, it will
undermine our standing in the city.

00:05:57.902 --> 00:05:58.994
Miss Kocho.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:00.662
Then, how about on the condition...

00:06:00.738 --> 00:06:04.435
...that we back off once we
get back what we're looking for?

00:06:06.411 --> 00:06:07.935
I suppose that's fine.

00:06:08.012 --> 00:06:11.539
We were only going to give them
a few more days free reign anyway.

00:06:15.186 --> 00:06:16.448
Shurei.

00:06:16.521 --> 00:06:17.647
Yes?

00:06:17.789 --> 00:06:20.781
Miss Kocho is one of the
Gang Alliance leaders.

00:06:20.859 --> 00:06:23.157
She's the leader responsible
for the red-light district.

00:06:23.228 --> 00:06:25.526
She's said to be the heroine
controlling the Gang Alliance...

00:06:25.597 --> 00:06:27.064
...from behind the scenes.

00:06:34.205 --> 00:06:36.173
So this is the Kogaro, huh?

00:06:36.641 --> 00:06:37.733
Boss!

00:06:39.110 --> 00:06:42.443
Don't you think it's a little too quiet?

00:06:46.284 --> 00:06:48.047
They're probably afraid of us.

00:06:48.419 --> 00:06:49.943
Let's go, guys!

00:06:50.021 --> 00:06:51.156
Yeah!

00:06:51.156 --> 00:06:52.885
Kogaro

00:07:03.968 --> 00:07:05.333
That's far enough!

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:12.841
So you dared to come,
you bunch of shameless lowlifes.

00:07:13.077 --> 00:07:16.444
We give you a little freedom,
and you act like you own the world.

00:07:16.714 --> 00:07:20.172
We're about to show you what you get
for what you've done in our territory.

00:07:20.618 --> 00:07:22.381
We won't go easy on you!

00:07:22.453 --> 00:07:26.890
Tonight, this place is surrounded by
all the leaders of Kiyo's underworld.

00:07:29.093 --> 00:07:31.220
Wh-What's that?

00:07:37.902 --> 00:07:41.633
You'll be sorry that you ever dared
step foot in here. Now...

00:07:42.473 --> 00:07:43.633
...let them have it!

00:07:43.708 --> 00:07:45.175
Yeah!

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:53.507
To think that Miss Kocho is one of
the leaders of the underworld.

00:07:53.885 --> 00:07:56.683
I'm glad now that I didn't
take her up on her offer.

00:07:56.754 --> 00:07:59.723
You fool! You don't seriously think
she'd spend time with you, do you?!

00:07:59.791 --> 00:08:01.691
Hey! Keep it down!

00:08:01.759 --> 00:08:02.919
Man!

00:08:03.761 --> 00:08:04.887
Um...!

00:08:06.064 --> 00:08:09.500
I should go out there, too.
That item is very important to me.

00:08:09.901 --> 00:08:12.631
If I lose it, my coming to Kiyo
will have no meaning.

00:08:13.037 --> 00:08:15.005
Can you fight?

00:08:16.074 --> 00:08:18.304
No, I can't.
In fact, I'm really weak.

00:08:19.177 --> 00:08:20.804
I'm weak too.

00:08:20.878 --> 00:08:24.279
The best I can do is search thugs
who are already down.

00:08:25.016 --> 00:08:26.347
Mr. Koyu!

00:08:26.417 --> 00:08:27.782
Shurei.
You come too.

00:08:27.852 --> 00:08:29.217
Ah, yes.

00:08:29.287 --> 00:08:32.188
You and Eigetsu stay where
I can see you.

00:08:32.657 --> 00:08:33.749
And me?

00:08:33.958 --> 00:08:35.391
I don't care about you.

00:08:39.163 --> 00:08:41.131
H-How could this have happened?!

00:08:47.672 --> 00:08:50.266
As long as I have these,
I won't need to worry about money.

00:09:00.785 --> 00:09:01.877
It's not here.

00:09:04.822 --> 00:09:07.723
I'll take you as my hostage
and get outta here.

00:09:07.792 --> 00:09:08.952
- Shurei!
- Shurei!

00:09:10.328 --> 00:09:12.728
So you're the snitch!
You bastard!

00:09:13.398 --> 00:09:15.832
I'm sorry! No, that's not right.

00:09:16.434 --> 00:09:18.095
- Let go of Shurei!
- Shurei!

00:09:19.404 --> 00:09:21.235
You damn brats!

00:09:37.622 --> 00:09:40.489
Is it my turn, Eigetsu?

00:09:41.759 --> 00:09:42.987
Yogetsu.

00:09:43.594 --> 00:09:45.391
Please save Shurei.

00:09:47.332 --> 00:09:49.732
Well, not that it's any of
my concern, but...!

00:09:52.103 --> 00:09:57.063
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:09:57.542 --> 00:09:59.510
Eigetsu! Eigetsu!

00:10:00.011 --> 00:10:01.535
- Eigetsu!
- Would you stand still?!

00:10:06.017 --> 00:10:07.143
Koyu!

00:10:07.719 --> 00:10:08.845
Are you all right?!

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.187
Yes.

00:10:11.689 --> 00:10:13.884
You bastard!

00:10:21.566 --> 00:10:23.033
Y-You!

00:10:27.238 --> 00:10:28.933
- You...
- Eigetsu!

00:10:29.173 --> 00:10:31.300
...damn brat!!

00:10:34.412 --> 00:10:35.811
I'm not Eigetsu.

00:10:36.948 --> 00:10:38.006
I'm...

00:10:39.484 --> 00:10:40.712
...Yogetsu!

00:10:40.818 --> 00:10:42.809
Y-Yogetsu?!

00:10:48.426 --> 00:10:50.690
So he's the one Shuei saw.

00:10:52.063 --> 00:10:53.189
Is that wine?

00:10:53.264 --> 00:10:55.824
It's not that he simply gets drunk.

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.868
He becomes a completely
different person!

00:10:59.303 --> 00:11:00.429
Here they are!

00:11:00.505 --> 00:11:01.472
This is it!

00:11:01.539 --> 00:11:03.166
- Help me pick them up, Shurei!
- Ah, yes!

00:11:04.342 --> 00:11:07.311
These are admittance tokens
for the Final Exam!

00:11:07.745 --> 00:11:10.111
How dare you do this,
Seikin Gang!

00:11:10.314 --> 00:11:11.281
Hey!

00:11:13.017 --> 00:11:14.143
Shurei!

00:11:19.590 --> 00:11:20.579
Shurei!

00:11:21.826 --> 00:11:22.850
Ryuki!

00:11:23.628 --> 00:11:24.595
Woman!

00:11:24.929 --> 00:11:26.863
Be more aware
of your surroundings!

00:11:31.502 --> 00:11:34.938
I only helped you because
Eigetsu asked me to.

00:11:35.006 --> 00:11:36.496
Don't expect it a second time.

00:11:36.908 --> 00:11:39.468
And one more thing.
Eigetsu's token isn't here.

00:11:42.146 --> 00:11:43.773
The alcohol is wearing off.

00:11:44.916 --> 00:11:45.974
Eigetsu!

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:50.888
His skills are really something.

00:11:51.289 --> 00:11:53.780
Quite impressive, I must say.

00:11:53.858 --> 00:11:56.418
My organization will be
taking that kid in.

00:11:56.494 --> 00:11:59.258
Are you kidding? I was
the first to set my eyes on him.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:02.629
I hate to break it to you,
but we had an interest in him first.

00:12:03.067 --> 00:12:05.297
And who might you be?
What's your name?

00:12:05.369 --> 00:12:06.734
Ryuki.

00:12:07.638 --> 00:12:09.105
Ryuki Shi.

00:12:13.744 --> 00:12:15.746
You have the same name
as the king, huh?

00:12:15.746 --> 00:12:17.839
I guess we'll have
to obey you then, right?

00:12:18.449 --> 00:12:21.850
But the bottom line is,
we saw him first.

00:12:22.053 --> 00:12:23.384
Not quite.

00:12:23.821 --> 00:12:26.449
From the moment Eigetsu
accepted this...

00:12:26.524 --> 00:12:28.389
...I had set my eyes on him.

00:12:29.327 --> 00:12:31.522
A kid like this is a final examinee?

00:12:31.596 --> 00:12:34.793
Or, ah, more importantly,
damn, those Seikin Gang bastards!

00:12:35.366 --> 00:12:39.029
Next time I hope you'll
take action a little sooner.

00:12:39.804 --> 00:12:43.103
Your delay almost put us
in a very undesirable position.

00:12:43.508 --> 00:12:45.976
To think they'd take examinees'
admittance tokens...

00:12:46.043 --> 00:12:49.342
...which they value more than their lives,
and use them for blackmail.

00:12:50.214 --> 00:12:52.580
I trust you'll give them
the punishment they deserve.

00:12:53.384 --> 00:12:58.447
Are you allowing us to repay our
debt to you by handling this matter?

00:13:00.391 --> 00:13:01.858
That seems only proper.

00:13:03.628 --> 00:13:07.587
We do not bow before you
because of the seat you occupy.

00:13:08.799 --> 00:13:10.562
To me, personally, then?

00:13:10.635 --> 00:13:11.602
Indeed.

00:13:11.669 --> 00:13:15.070
We bow before you for righting
the mistake we made...

00:13:15.139 --> 00:13:18.302
...before matters
became irrevocable.

00:13:19.343 --> 00:13:23.109
And also, to offer you
my sincere apologies...

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.444
...for failing to keep
our agreement.

00:13:26.717 --> 00:13:29.185
- What's going on?
- Is that really him?

00:13:46.871 --> 00:13:50.432
With today's incident,
the Gang Alliance owes us one favor.

00:13:51.475 --> 00:13:53.443
But more importantly,
for the time being...

00:13:53.511 --> 00:13:56.105
...it would seem they have
acknowledged us as worthy allies.

00:13:57.048 --> 00:13:59.312
This turn of events is certainly
an unexpected surprise.

00:14:01.085 --> 00:14:03.053
Is that my exam ticket?!

00:14:03.154 --> 00:14:05.679
No it isn't.
Shurei, did you find it?

00:14:06.057 --> 00:14:07.251
No.

00:14:07.592 --> 00:14:11.426
The other Eigetsu said
it isn't here.

00:14:12.263 --> 00:14:14.857
But he fell asleep before
he could tell me where it is.

00:14:17.902 --> 00:14:19.062
Eigetsu?

00:14:19.136 --> 00:14:20.433
I'll drink some wine!

00:14:21.405 --> 00:14:23.839
But you can't drink wine, right?

00:14:24.308 --> 00:14:29.302
I'll get Yogetsu to come out.
So please ask him where he left it!

00:14:30.014 --> 00:14:32.312
- Oww!
- You can't do a thing like that!

00:14:32.483 --> 00:14:36.613
But that token can't be reissued!
I have to find it!

00:14:36.687 --> 00:14:39.622
I know! And I completely understand
how you feel, but...!

00:14:39.757 --> 00:14:41.952
Um... Excuse me.

00:14:42.193 --> 00:14:43.717
Pardon my intrusion.

00:14:44.862 --> 00:14:46.489
Santa's father!

00:14:46.564 --> 00:14:49.931
Oh, Miss Shurei.
Long time no see.

00:14:50.234 --> 00:14:53.965
Thanks for always being
so good to my foolish son.

00:14:55.072 --> 00:14:59.270
Well now, is there
a Mr. Eigetsu To here?

00:15:00.678 --> 00:15:02.145
Th-That would be me.

00:15:02.213 --> 00:15:04.010
Yes, yes! You!

00:15:04.081 --> 00:15:07.107
Thank you so much for the order
you placed last night.

00:15:07.451 --> 00:15:09.942
Having such
an outstanding young man...

00:15:10.021 --> 00:15:12.285
...the youngest in history...

00:15:12.356 --> 00:15:17.350
...to pass the Provincial Exams,
visit our store was truly an honor.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:23.130
My admittance token! D-Did Yogetsu...
Ah, no, did I give this to you?!

00:15:23.334 --> 00:15:25.302
Have you forgotten?

00:15:26.170 --> 00:15:29.435
I went a little overboard today.
It could very well lead to trouble.

00:15:30.107 --> 00:15:32.098
Please deliver this with the wine.

00:15:32.176 --> 00:15:35.009
Otherwise, being the dimwit he is, he's
likely to end up losing it in all the chaos.

00:15:35.379 --> 00:15:37.540
Deliver them to the number one
whorehouse in Kiyo.

00:15:37.615 --> 00:15:39.173
Late tomorrow evening will do.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.844
Those were your words,
were they not?

00:15:41.919 --> 00:15:44.547
And here is the wine you ordered.

00:15:44.722 --> 00:15:46.883
My, you certainly have
discriminating taste.

00:15:46.957 --> 00:15:51.656
Even the king rarely enjoys
wine of this quality.

00:15:52.763 --> 00:15:57.166
One bottle alone costs ten gold
and thirty silver coins.

00:15:57.234 --> 00:15:59.202
No wonder you had
so little money left.

00:15:59.503 --> 00:16:03.963
Now then, when my third son
sleeping over there wakes up...

00:16:04.175 --> 00:16:07.838
...please be so kind as to tell him
to walk home by himself.

00:16:08.079 --> 00:16:12.982
Well then, my humble store welcomes
your patronage in the future.

00:16:15.786 --> 00:16:17.083
Eigetsu To.

00:16:17.788 --> 00:16:19.722
From Seika village in Koku Province.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:21.724
Suikyodo Temple serving
as your sponsor.

00:16:22.159 --> 00:16:25.094
At age twelve, you topped
the Koku Provincial Exam...

00:16:25.529 --> 00:16:28.157
...and this year, at thirteen,
you'll be taking the Final Exam.

00:16:29.133 --> 00:16:31.067
I'm very glad your token
was returned to you.

00:16:31.702 --> 00:16:34.728
Pass the exam,
then come and serve me.

00:16:36.974 --> 00:16:38.066
You are...!

00:16:39.944 --> 00:16:41.070
Yes!

00:16:41.645 --> 00:16:43.078
You too.

00:16:45.816 --> 00:16:47.147
I'll be waiting for you.

00:16:55.993 --> 00:16:58.518
So, today is your last day, Shurei.

00:16:58.596 --> 00:17:00.860
Yes. Thank you for everything.

00:17:01.699 --> 00:17:03.826
Like I told you, I have a gift for you.

00:17:04.902 --> 00:17:07.996
This complete makeup set,
with instructions on how to apply it.

00:17:08.572 --> 00:17:11.700
B-But I don't wear makeup.

00:17:12.376 --> 00:17:14.173
We had a promise, didn't we?

00:17:15.246 --> 00:17:17.214
Got that? It's a promise.

00:17:17.515 --> 00:17:19.483
Otherwise, I'll tell Mr. Hong and Seiran...

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:22.075
...that you've been working
in the red-light district.

00:17:22.787 --> 00:17:26.553
Now that you mention it, are you
acquainted with my father and Seiran?

00:17:28.192 --> 00:17:29.659
Sure.

00:17:30.761 --> 00:17:33.321
I met your father shortly
after you began working here.

00:17:33.397 --> 00:17:36.127
He came here on his own.

00:17:36.801 --> 00:17:39.065
Father knew that
I was working here?!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:44.171
He bowed very politely and said,
"Please take good care of my daughter."

00:17:44.575 --> 00:17:46.236
Huh? What?!

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:49.040
"My daughter only recently
lost her mother."

00:17:49.346 --> 00:17:51.337
From here on in,
she will probably...

00:17:51.415 --> 00:17:54.009
...encounter many things that I,
as a man, will not understand.

00:17:54.585 --> 00:17:56.746
So please take care of her.

00:17:57.021 --> 00:17:58.147
Like that.

00:17:58.589 --> 00:18:01.422
Then after that,
Seiran also came by.

00:18:02.259 --> 00:18:05.888
He said exactly the same things
that Mr. Hong had said, and then left.

00:18:07.231 --> 00:18:09.358
I couldn't help but laugh.

00:18:09.934 --> 00:18:11.526
Seiran too?

00:18:11.602 --> 00:18:14.036
So that's why he knew
about Kogaro.

00:18:14.271 --> 00:18:15.499
All right, it's done.

00:18:17.675 --> 00:18:18.733
Take a look.

00:18:23.647 --> 00:18:25.581
Remember this.

00:18:25.649 --> 00:18:28.049
Makeup is a woman's war paint.

00:18:28.419 --> 00:18:31.855
Make sure you wear it
whenever you head into battle.

00:18:32.389 --> 00:18:34.857
That way, you definitely cannot cry.

00:18:35.659 --> 00:18:38.059
Because if you cry,
your makeup will run.

00:18:38.128 --> 00:18:39.789
And no matter how
little you applied...

00:18:39.864 --> 00:18:41.923
...your face will end up
looking disgraceful.

00:18:41.999 --> 00:18:43.728
That's why, no matter
how difficult things get...

00:18:43.801 --> 00:18:45.894
...you'll keep yourself from crying.

00:18:47.438 --> 00:18:49.872
You're heading into battle,
aren't you?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.532
Give it everything you've got.

00:18:52.276 --> 00:18:56.110
Your courage and determination
make me proud.

00:18:57.815 --> 00:18:59.282
Miss Kocho.

00:18:59.350 --> 00:19:02.319
Come on, don't you start crying.
Listen.

00:19:02.920 --> 00:19:06.321
No matter what others say, you must
never lose pride in being a woman.

00:19:07.024 --> 00:19:09.492
Even if you find yourself standing
on the same stage as men...

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:11.960
...don't ever try to become a man.

00:19:12.029 --> 00:19:15.294
As a woman,
do the things that men can't.

00:19:17.301 --> 00:19:20.168
And if anyone gives you a hard time,
be sure to tell me.

00:19:20.671 --> 00:19:22.832
And if that man dares come
to the red-light district...

00:19:22.907 --> 00:19:25.705
...I'll give him a beating he'll
never forget before throwing him out!

00:19:26.610 --> 00:19:29.545
Coming from you, Miss Kocho,
I know it's no joke.

00:19:30.347 --> 00:19:34.249
That's because I'm serious.
I'm not the only one either.

00:19:34.318 --> 00:19:36.286
The same goes for
Mr. Hong and Seiran.

00:19:36.754 --> 00:19:39.985
There are many people around you
who care very much about you.

00:19:41.158 --> 00:19:42.853
Go forth.

00:19:43.060 --> 00:19:46.052
You will definitely become
a fine woman.

00:20:06.717 --> 00:20:10.016
I'm gonna fight with all I've got.

00:20:11.989 --> 00:20:15.982
Is it possible
I'm making a big mistake?

00:20:17.061 --> 00:20:19.791
Shurei said she wants to become
a Royal Court Official.

00:20:20.164 --> 00:20:24.760
If that actually happens, Shurei will
fulfill her duty, without question.

00:20:25.202 --> 00:20:27.329
Yes. As a Royal Court Official.

00:20:29.840 --> 00:20:32.809
Yet I can't help but feel that it's
somewhat different from what I desire.

00:20:33.477 --> 00:20:37.573
Although physically closer, I sense that
there'd be more distance between us.

00:20:38.282 --> 00:20:39.408
Your Majesty.

00:20:40.985 --> 00:20:42.953
Regardless of the circumstances...

00:20:43.020 --> 00:20:46.387
...the difficulty of trying to direct
someone's affections towards you...

00:20:46.457 --> 00:20:48.425
...will not change anything.

00:20:48.959 --> 00:20:51.553
So what if Shurei does become
a Royal Court Official?

00:20:51.628 --> 00:20:53.323
What difference will that make?

00:20:53.797 --> 00:20:57.961
The things you must do, Your Majesty,
will not change at all, will they?

00:21:01.605 --> 00:21:02.867
You're right.

00:21:05.042 --> 00:21:06.475
You're absolutely right.

00:21:10.981 --> 00:21:12.915
A woman is taking
the National Exam?

00:21:12.983 --> 00:21:14.951
And there's a kid here too.

00:21:16.487 --> 00:21:19.183
We're being gawked at like we're
a couple of rare animals, aren't we?

00:21:24.261 --> 00:21:26.729
Has another rare animal
arrived or something?

00:21:28.198 --> 00:21:29.961
Don't tell me, that's...

00:21:33.937 --> 00:21:35.063
...Ryuren!

00:21:35.139 --> 00:21:37.369
Oh, Shurei, my kindred spirit!

00:21:38.409 --> 00:21:40.138
It's been a while, hasn't it?

00:21:40.544 --> 00:21:43.138
Oh, this is General Ran's
younger brother.

00:21:43.213 --> 00:21:44.874
He's also taking the Final Exam.

00:21:45.449 --> 00:21:49.112
This is Eigetsu To.
Um... we're friends, right?

00:21:49.853 --> 00:21:51.115
Yes.

00:21:51.889 --> 00:21:54.858
My friend! Any friend of Shurei's
is a friend of mine.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.152
Eigetsu To!
You're my kindred spirit, too.

00:22:01.365 --> 00:22:07.270
Look at this! Even the snow is blessing
our friendship and bright future!

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:13.843
All right! Let's get going to the
Final Exam, and into battle!

00:22:15.412 --> 00:22:16.344
Come!

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:19.080
Let me play a courageous tune.

00:22:28.358 --> 00:22:30.223
We absolutely have to pass, okay?

00:22:30.661 --> 00:22:32.492
Yes. Absolutely.

00:22:32.563 --> 00:22:34.190
Okay then.
Let's get going.

00:22:34.932 --> 00:22:38.891
Oh, by the way, you look
very pretty with your makeup!

00:22:40.003 --> 00:22:44.337
I know I'm lousy at applying it,
so there's no need to flatter me.

00:22:46.677 --> 00:22:50.204
The results of this year's National
Examinations shocked everyone.

00:22:52.616 --> 00:22:56.143
Standing above all other examinees and
impressively taking first place...

00:22:56.487 --> 00:23:00.617
...Eigetsu To, age thirteen,
was awarded the title of Jogen.

00:23:01.458 --> 00:23:04.484
He thus became the youngest person in
history to pass the National Exams.

00:23:07.131 --> 00:23:10.501
Second place, the title of Bogen
was awarded to Ryuren Ran...

00:23:10.501 --> 00:23:12.230
...eighteen years old.

00:23:12.603 --> 00:23:14.696
An incredibly gifted eccentric.

00:23:16.673 --> 00:23:20.336
And third place, the title of Tanka was
awarded to Shurei Hong...

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:21.741
...age seventeen.

00:23:21.812 --> 00:23:25.543
The winter of the third year of
the Jochi Era saw the arrival...

00:23:26.016 --> 00:23:28.610
...of Saiunkoku's first female
Royal Court Official.

00:23:30.554 --> 00:23:35.651
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.792 --> 00:23:42.356
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.466 --> 00:23:47.529
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.638 --> 00:23:52.632
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:58.170
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.716 --> 00:24:04.847
You are just like me

00:24:05.589 --> 00:24:10.117
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.194 --> 00:24:16.099
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.067 --> 00:24:22.869
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:22.973 --> 00:24:27.842
I will always think of you

00:24:28.979 --> 00:24:41.653
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.128 --> 00:24:45.862
Next Episode

00:24:45.862 --> 00:24:47.664
Next Episode
The dream I never imagined
could come true...

00:24:47.664 --> 00:24:47.698
Next Episode

00:24:47.698 --> 00:24:47.898
Next Episode
...has been realized.

00:24:47.898 --> 00:24:49.333
Next Episode
Three Years on a Rock
...has been realized.

00:24:49.333 --> 00:24:49.366
Next Episode
Three Years on a Rock

00:24:49.366 --> 00:24:52.636
Next Episode
Three Years on a Rock
I've taken my first step in becoming
a Royal Court Official.

00:24:52.636 --> 00:24:52.669
Next Episode
Three Years on a Rock

00:24:52.669 --> 00:24:54.171
Next Episode
Three Years on a Rock
I wonder what
my first assignment will be?

00:24:54.171 --> 00:24:54.603
I wonder what
my first assignment will be?

00:24:54.671 --> 00:24:56.969
What? Cleaning the toilets?
